# Admin Assets

## JavaScript (`admin/js/checklistdek-admin.js`)

- Wrap in an IIFE with `'use strict'`; guard on `typeof checklistdekAdmin`.
- REST helpers: `request()`, `get()`, `post()`, `put()`, `del()` — all send `X-WP-Nonce` via `getRestNonce()` (mutable copy of localized nonce). `initRestNonceRefresh()` listens for bare `heartbeat-tick` (not a jQuery namespaced event) and updates from `data.rest_nonce` when Heartbeat is available. `request()` maps `rest_cookie_invalid_nonce` / `rest_forbidden` to `strings.sessionExpired`. `buildApiUrl(path)` / `splitApiPath()` / `mergeExtraQuery()` build URLs for pretty (`/wp-json/`) and plain (`?rest_route=`) permalinks; `buildPlainPermalinkFallbackUrl()` retries on `rest_no_route` when pretty permalinks are configured but rewrites are broken (common on local MAMP).
- Admin-ajax helper: `postAjax( action, data )` — POSTs to `checklistdekAdmin.ajaxUrl` with `action`, `wp_rest` `nonce` (always current via `getRestNonce()`; ignores duplicate `nonce` in `data`), `X-WP-Nonce` header, and URL-encoded fields (objects JSON-stringified); parses `{ success, data }` JSON responses; treats bare `0`/`-1` body and HTTP 403 as expired session (`strings.sessionExpired`). Server validates via `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin_Ajax::verify_ajax_nonce()` — `get_request_nonce()` reads POST `nonce` or `HTTP_X_WP_NONCE` (JSON 403 on failure). Used for integration sync/preview/push, telemetry rules, site run history, and Activity Logs list pagination to avoid full REST bootstrap on memory-constrained installs (Community and Pro — same handlers).
- DOM helpers: `el( tag, attrs, children )`, `fillSelect( select, items, valueKey, labelKey, placeholder )`, `escHtml()` / `escAttr()` (shared escaping for dynamic markup); notices via `notice( container, message, type )` (HTML-escapes message) or `noticeHtml( container, innerHtml, type )` for trusted inline markup such as admin links; renders WordPress core `.notice` / `.notice-error` / `.notice-success` with `<p>` wrapper; pass empty message to clear.
- Scope queries to `.checklistdek-admin` or `[data-checklistdek-page]`.
- No jQuery unless WordPress already loads it.
- On `DOMContentLoaded`: set `data-checklistdek-ready="true"`, then `initRestNonceRefresh()`, global inits (`initTemplatePicker`, `initOnboarding`, `initConfirmModal`, `initFieldTooltips`) before page inits; `initSettings()` runs last.

### Global modal inits (any screen with modal markup)

| Function | Modal | Notes |
|----------|-------|-------|
| `initTemplatePicker()` | `#checklistdek-template-picker-modal` | Runs when modal partial is present; exposes `window.checklistdekOpenTemplatePicker(callbacks)` |
| `initOnboarding()` | `#checklistdek-onboarding-modal` | Runs when modal partial is present; exposes `window.checklistdekOpenOnboarding()` |
| `initConfirmModal()` | `#checklistdek-wp-confirm-root` | Always runs on plugin screens; mounts `wp.components.__experimentalConfirmDialog` via `wp.element.createRoot()`; `openConfirmModal({ message, title?, confirmText?, destructive?, onConfirm })` — pauses open `.checklistdek-modal` nodes while open, supports async `onConfirm` Promise, falls back to `window.confirm()` when ConfirmDialog unavailable |
| `initFieldTooltips()` | `#checklistdek-field-tooltip` | Always runs on plugin screens; fixed-position portal for `.checklistdek-has-tooltip` / `data-tooltip` (Settings, Integrations section headings, builder field info) — avoids overflow clipping in sidebars and tables |

