### Build edition gating (all plugin screens)

PHP unsets capture-related `strings.*` when `!can_use_auto_capture()` and vault strings when `!can_use_agency_vault()`. Community gates:

- `initAutoCapture()` — no-ops when Auto-Capture markup is absent (Community omits tab/panel in PHP).
- `loadVaultTemplates()` — no-ops when `#checklistdek-vault-list` is absent (Community omits vault card in PHP).
- Settings **Webhooks & Email** tab — rendered only when `CHECKLISTDEK_Licensing::can_use_notifications()`; scheduled drift toggle only when `can_use_scheduled_drift()` (Community sees no Pro placeholders in Settings).

Each page init no-ops if `[data-checklistdek-page="{page}"]` is absent (except `initTemplates()`, which keys off `#checklistdek-builtin-templates`). Template picker and onboarding inits no-op if their modal element is absent; `initConfirmModal()` always prepares the ConfirmDialog root.

### Sites page run history

Key elements: `.checklistdek-site-history-toggle`, `.checklistdek-site-runs-row`, `.checklistdek-site-runs-panel`, `.checklistdek-site-runs-table`, `.checklistdek-site-runs-load-more`, `#checklistdek-site-info-modal`, `.checklistdek-site-info-body`, `.checklistdek-site-more-info`.

- `toggleSiteRuns( siteId )` / `setSiteHistoryOpen()` — expand/collapse nested runs row; toggles `.is-history-open` on parent `.checklistdek-site-row`.
- `loadSiteRuns( siteId, panel )` — fetches admin-ajax `checklistdek_get_site_runs` (`site_id`, `limit: 25`, `offset: 0`), caches in `siteRunsCache` with in-flight dedup (`siteRunsPending`); `normalizeSiteRunsResponse()` handles legacy array or `{ runs, has_more }` shape.
- `loadMoreSiteRuns( siteId, panel, btn )` — appends next page when `has_more`; `siteRunsMorePending` prevents duplicate requests.
- `invalidateSiteRunsCache( siteId )` — clears cache and re-fetches when panel is open after push/archive/delete.
- `renderSiteRunsPanel()` / `siteRunRowHtml()` — checklist title, Steps progress (`.checklistdek-run-progress`), started/completed timestamps, started-by (read-only history; no per-run actions).
- `openSiteInfoModal( siteId )` / `renderSiteInfoBody()` — **More info** modal with ID, URL, connection, panel, credentials summary, tags, and versions.

### Client panel setup helpers

Shared block markup in `checklistdek-panel-setup-block.php` (title **Client checklist panel setup**, numbered steps, path hint `wp-content/mu-plugins/checklistdek-client.php`, notice area `#…-panel-setup-result`); JS uses ID map constants `PANEL_SETUP_SITES`, `PANEL_SETUP_ONBOARDING`, `PANEL_SETUP_TESTER`.

- `togglePanelSetup( show, ids )` — show/hide `.checklistdek-panel-setup` root (`[hidden]`).
- `panelStatusFromResponse( response )` — reads `client_panel` or `client_agent` from test/save payloads.
- `updatePanelSetupStatus( status, ids )` — success hides block and optional success notice on parent test result; failure shows block + inline notice in `#…-panel-setup-result`.
- `downloadPanelBootstrap( ids )` — `GET /panel/bootstrap` → Blob download `checklistdek-client.php`.
- `retryPanelInstall( siteId, ids )` — `POST /sites/{id}/panel/install`; requires saved site (Sites/onboarding only).

Connection test and site save handlers call `updatePanelSetupStatus()` when `client_panel.success` is false. Opening site editor shows panel setup when stored site lacks installed panel.

### Checklists page sections

- `initChecklistTabs()` — toggles `[data-checklistdek-tab-panel]` via `.checklistdek-checklist-nav` `[data-checklistdek-tab]` buttons; lazy-inits auto-capture site select when **Auto-Capture** tab opens (`initAutoCapturePanel()`); updates `?tab=` via `history.replaceState` (`templates` clears param; leaving **My Checklists** clears `checklist_id`). Legacy `?tab=builder` normalizes to `my-checklists`.
- Initial panel: `my-checklists` when `?checklist_id=` or `?tab=my-checklists` (or legacy `builder`), else `templates` (default).
- `fetchCustomChecklistSummaries( forceRefresh? )` — cached `GET /checklists?is_template=0&summary=1`; uses `checklistdekAdmin.customChecklists` when `preloaded`; `invalidateCustomChecklistSummaries()` on mutations.
- `refreshCustomChecklistUi( forceRefresh? )` — one fetch updates `#checklistdek-checklist-select` and `#checklistdek-vault-checklist` (no custom checklist card grid).
- `loadChecklistList()` — delegates to `refreshCustomChecklistUi()`; change handler on `#checklistdek-checklist-select` loads editor or hides it when empty.
- `openChecklistEditor( id )` — switches to **My Checklists** tab, sets `?tab=my-checklists&checklist_id=`, loads editor.
- `createChecklistFromTemplate( slug )` / `duplicateChecklist( tpl )` — clone via REST (`duplicateChecklist` fetches full checklist first) then `openChecklistEditor()`; built-in/vault cards use **Use Checklist** (`.checklistdek-template-use-checklist`).
- Deep-link inference: `hydrateStepDeepLinks()`, `scheduleDeepLinkInference()` (300ms debounce), `runDeepLinkInference()` — client-side rules + `POST /checklists/infer-deep-link`; `deep_link_auto` / `deep_link_manual` track auto vs user-edited paths; hint via `#ld-step-deeplink-hint`. Field tooltips render icon-before-label via `renderFieldLabel()` / `renderFieldInfo()`; Step Type tooltip updates via `updateStepTypeHelpTooltip()` on type change.
- Builder preview: `renderChecklistPreview()` / `renderClientPreviewPanel()` — mirrors client sidebar panel in `#checklistdek-checklist-preview` (pointer-events disabled); renders ChecklistDek brand mark via `renderClientPreviewBrand()` (`checklistdekAdmin.clientPreview.brandName`); `#checklistdek-cl-panel-title` debounced save (`scheduleClientPanelTitleSave()` / `saveClientPanelTitle()` → `POST /settings/client-panel-title`); title/description inputs re-render preview on `input`.

### Automation helpers

Key elements: `.checklistdek-automation-nav`, `.checklistdek-automation-wizard`, `#checklistdek-automation-progress`, `#checklistdek-automation-step-1|2|3`, `#checklistdek-run-checklist`, `#checklistdek-run-site-picker`, `#checklistdek-batch-site-picker`, `#checklistdek-batch-checklist`, `#checklistdek-run-notice`, `#checklistdek-batch-notice`, `#checklistdek-run-activity-feed`, `#checklistdek-run-activity-intro`, `#checklistdek-run-activity-view-all`.

- `initAutomationTabs()` — toggles `[data-checklistdek-automation-panel]` via `.checklistdek-automation-nav` `[data-checklistdek-automation-tab]` (`run|batch|drift`); updates `?tab=` via `history.replaceState` (`run` clears param). Returns `showAutomationTab`.
- `goToAutomationStep( step )` / `updateAutomationProgress( step )` — wizard steps 1–3 within Run tab; step 3 shows empty state until a run starts or `?run_id=` loads.
- `updateAutomationStepButtons()` — enables `#checklistdek-automation-step1-next` when checklist selected; `#checklistdek-start-run` when checklist + exactly one site selected.
- `renderTargetSitesPicker( pickerId, preserveSelected?, singleSelect? )` — builds multicheck dropdown from `cachedSites`; run picker uses `singleSelect: true` (radio-style); batch picker allows multiple.
