- `renderRun( run )` — switches to step 3 + Run tab, renders `#checklistdek-run-info`, `#checklistdek-run-progress-wrap` (`.checklistdek-run-progress`), `#checklistdek-run-steps`; calls `updateRunActivityPanel( run )`.
- `updateRunActivityPanel( run )` / `loadRunActivityFeed( siteId )` / `refreshRunActivityFeed()` — site-scoped compact feed (`RUN_ACTIVITY_FEED_LIMIT` 8) via `GET /logs/feed?detailed=1&include_details=0`; **View all activity logs** link scoped to run site.
- `runNotice( message, type )` / `batchNotice( message, type )` — inline feedback; no `alert()`.

