### Auto-capture helpers

Key elements: `#checklistdek-panel-auto-capture`, `.checklistdek-auto-capture-panel`, `#checklistdek-auto-capture-site`, `#checklistdek-auto-capture-status`, `#checklistdek-auto-capture-steps`, `#checklistdek-auto-capture-start`, `#checklistdek-auto-capture-stop`, `#checklistdek-auto-capture-import`, `#checklistdek-auto-capture-clear`, `#checklistdek-auto-capture-notice`.

- `initAutoCapture()` — binds capture controls when `#checklistdek-auto-capture-site` exists; no-ops otherwise.
