### Template picker helpers

Key elements: `#checklistdek-template-picker-filters`, `#checklistdek-template-picker-list`, `#checklistdek-template-picker-steps`, `#checklistdek-template-picker-steps-list`, `#checklistdek-template-picker-notice`, `#checklistdek-template-picker-blank`, `#checklistdek-template-picker-cancel`, `#checklistdek-template-picker-import`.

- `loadPickerTemplates()` — caches `GET /templates` (`builtin`, `categories`).
- `openTemplatePicker(callbacks)` — opens modal; callbacks: `{ importMode?, onImport, onBlank }`. Default `importMode` is `checklist` (`POST /templates/{slug}/clone` → `onImport(checklist)`); `populate` passes template object to `onImport` (onboarding paste flow). Exposed as `window.checklistdekOpenTemplatePicker`.
- `closeTemplatePicker()`, `importSelectedTemplate()` — close on backdrop/close/cancel; import on **Import Template** (`#checklistdek-template-picker-import`, disabled until a template is selected).
- `renderPickerFilters()`, `renderPickerList()`, `renderPickerStepsPreview()` — category capsule tabs, selectable list items (`.checklistdek-template-picker-item.is-selected`), steps aside.
- `templateToPasteText( template )` — converts template title + step titles to plain-text SOP format for onboarding paste field.
- `updatePickerImportButton()` — enables/disables import button based on `pickerSelectedSlug`.

### Onboarding helpers

- `parsePastedChecklist( text )` — parses headings, bullets, and numbered lines into `{ title, steps[] }`.
- `buildChecklistPayload( parsed )` — converts parsed steps to manual checklist REST payload.
- `getPasteText()` — returns trimmed textarea value, falling back to placeholder when empty (used for step validation).
- `getPreviewSourceText()` — returns `{ text, isSample }`; when textarea is empty, renders placeholder as a dimmed sample preview (`.is-sample`, disabled checkboxes).
- `updateOnboardingProgress( step )` — toggles `.is-active` / `.is-complete` on `#checklistdek-onboarding-progress` segment nodes (`data-step="1|2"`).
- `updateStep2SiteState()` — syncs `#checklistdek-onboarding-site` selection with connect panel visibility and connection status.
- `closeOnboarding()` — sets `modal.hidden = true` immediately (no network wait).
- `dismissOnboarding()` — `POST /onboarding/dismiss` (fire-and-forget).
- `dismissAndCloseOnboarding()` — close icon, backdrop, and Skip buttons; closes UI first, then persists dismiss in background.
- `openOnboardingModal()` / `resetOnboardingModal()` — exposed as `window.checklistdekOpenOnboarding`; resets form state before each open.
- `initOnboarding()` — 2-step modal flow:
  - **Step 1** (`#checklistdek-onboarding-step-1`): paste SOP text (`#checklistdek-onboarding-paste`) → live preview (`#checklistdek-onboarding-preview`); placeholder shows sample preview until user types; **Start from a template** (`#checklistdek-onboarding-use-template`) opens template picker with `importMode: populate`.
  - **Step 2** (`#checklistdek-onboarding-step-2`): optional existing-site select (`#checklistdek-onboarding-site` inside `#checklistdek-onboarding-existing-sites` — hidden until `GET /sites` returns rows) or new-site connect panel (`#checklistdek-onboarding-connect-panel`, `/sites/test`, `/sites`) → `#checklistdek-onboarding-panel-setup` when panel missing after test/save → save checklist (`POST /checklists`) → optional run (`POST /runs`) → dismiss (`POST /onboarding/dismiss`).
  - Auto-opens when `data-checklistdek-page="dashboard"` and `checklistdekAdmin.onboarding.show` is true, or when URL has `?onboarding=1` (any page with modal markup); Settings **Show onboarding wizard** resets via `POST /onboarding/reset` then calls `checklistdekOpenOnboarding()` — saving settings alone does not auto-open the wizard.

### `checklistdekAdmin` shape

```javascript
{
	restUrl: string,    // rest_url( 'checklistdek/v1' )
	ajaxUrl: string,    // admin_url( 'admin-ajax.php' ) — postAjax() target
	nonce: string,      // wp_create_nonce( 'wp_rest' )
	adminUrl: string,
	pageSlug: string,
	roles: object,      // WP role slug => translated label (for step target_roles UI)
	templates?: {       // dashboard, checklists, settings — template picker / built-in grid preload
		preloaded: boolean,
