### Responsive (admin + client preview)

Hub admin CSS uses stacked toolbars/forms and horizontal scroll on wide tables below ~960px / ~782px. Sites table hides WP/PHP version columns at `max-width: 782px`; site run history panels scroll horizontally on small screens. Modals and onboarding progress segments wrap on narrow viewports. Client panel bundle CSS (`checklistdek-client-admin.css`) widens step actions on very small devices — mirror behavior in builder preview when touching client styles.

## Partials (`admin/partials/`)

Thin shells only — no business logic. Each page partial sets `data-checklistdek-page` on `.checklistdek-admin` root (including `settings`). Settings page uses Settings API form, not REST-driven CRUD.

Shared modal partials (require at end of page partial, do not duplicate markup):

| Partial | Included on |
|---------|-------------|
| `checklistdek-onboarding-modal.php` | dashboard, settings |
| `checklistdek-template-picker-modal.php` | dashboard, checklists, settings |
| `checklistdek-panel-setup-block.php` | sites (editor + connection tester modals), onboarding step 2 (via `require` inside onboarding modal) |

Dashboard and settings include both onboarding + template picker modals (onboarding opens the picker from step 1). Checklists includes the template picker partial and inline auto-capture tab panel (no auto-capture modal). Sites page includes push checklist, connection tester, and **More info** (`#checklistdek-site-info-modal`) modals inline; panel setup block is embedded in site editor and tester (not a standalone modal). Destructive confirmations use `openConfirmModal()` (WordPress `ConfirmDialog` via `wp-components`; no PHP partial).

## Client panel assets (`mu-plugin/checklistdek-client/`)

Bundled mu-plugin admin UI — not loaded by hub `checklistdek-admin` handle. Enqueued on remote wp-admin only when `CHECKLISTDEK_Client_Run_Store::get()` returns an active snapshot and `user_can_view_panel()` passes for the current user.

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `css/checklistdek-client-admin.css` | Panel styles — prefix `.checklistdek-client-*` |
| `js/checklistdek-client-admin.js` | Panel UI — IIFE, `checklistdekClient` global (`restUrl`, `nonce`, `run`, `currentUser`, `strings`); uses `wp.media` for optional screenshot attachments; note collapse prefs in `localStorage` |

Key helpers: `buildClientApiUrl()` / `clientFetch()` — REST calls with plain-permalink `?rest_route=` fallback on `rest_no_route` (mirrors hub admin JS); `clientFetch()` injects `X-WP-Nonce` from `getClientNonce()` when omitted. bare `heartbeat-tick` updates nonce from `data.rest_nonce`. `stepShowsNoteField()` / `stepShowsScreenshotField()` — gate note textarea and screenshot attach button from snapshot `show_note_field` / `show_screenshot_field`. `formatCompactProgress()` / `syncAdminBarProgress()` — keep collapsed layouts (sidebar tab, pill, toast, bars, fullscreen launcher, `admin_menu` trigger, `#wp-admin-bar-checklistdek-client-checklist`) in sync on step toggles. `layoutKeepsPanelChromeOnCollapse()` — `inline_metabox` keeps panel chrome when collapsed (progress meta + **Expand** toggle). `applyOptimisticStepUpdate()` / `updateStepStatus()` — optimistic complete/uncomplete with rollback on error; hub callbacks return updated `run` (no redundant hub→client re-sync). Step complete/uncomplete posts `POST /client/run/steps/{step}/complete|uncomplete` → hub token route → applies returned snapshot via `save()` / `patch_from_hub_run()`. Per-step `.checklistdek-client-step-notes-toggle` collapses individual note lists (prefs in `localStorage`).

Key panel classes: `.checklistdek-client-panel-root`, `.checklistdek-client-panel`, `.checklistdek-client-panel-brand`, `.checklistdek-client-panel-brand-mark`, `.checklistdek-client-panel-brand-name`, `.checklistdek-client-panel-brand-icon`, `.checklistdek-client-panel-tab`, `.checklistdek-client-panel-toggle`, `.checklistdek-client-panel-collapsed-meta`, `.checklistdek-client-admin-menu-trigger`, `.checklistdek-client-step`, `.checklistdek-client-step-settings-link` (compact deep-link icon beside step actions; URL from snapshot `deep_link` or rebuilt from `admin_path`), `.checklistdek-client-step-notes`, `.checklistdek-client-step-notes-toggle`, `.checklistdek-client-double-tick-icons`, `.checklistdek-client-icon-double-tick`, `.checklistdek-client-note-attachment`, `.checklistdek-client-run-complete-summary`, `.checklistdek-client-dismiss-run`. Panel heading from snapshot `panel_title` (`CHECKLISTDEK_Client_Run_Store::get_panel_title()`; hub setting `client_panel_title`); brand label from localized `strings.brandName`. Layout modifiers on root/body: `.checklistdek-client-layout-{sidebar|live_topbar|bottom_dock|floating_pill|toast|admin_menu|fullscreen|focus_mode|inline_metabox}` (legacy `left_sidebar` / `split_panel` fall back to `sidebar`); `body.checklistdek-client-has-panel`. Modifiers: `.is-collapsed` on panel root/panel/step notes/metabox; `.is-completed` on steps. Completed runs show summary + **Dismiss** (`POST /client/run/dismiss`).

